  "releaseNotes": "11.0.0\n\n* New: a net11.0 build, for .NET 11 and EF Core 11. On .NET 11 the package asks for\n  Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Relational 11.0.0 or later. The net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 builds\n  stay, each with its own EF Core as before, so nothing changes for a project on an earlier .NET.\n* The major version is 11 because it follows the .NET generation, like the rest of the Com.H\n  family. No API was added, changed or removed since 10.0.0.3.\n* The Com.H.Data.Common dependency moves to 11.x.",
